  "source_note": "The mirrored files match the identified firmware commit. Version 1.0.0 includes two original shared FX banks (R/D and C/F, eight types each), independent part sends, v7 project migration, and matching SENDS/TYPES controls. Master output remains volume and limiter only. This is not a Roland algorithm emulation; physical sensing and pressure remain excluded. Eight melodic/six drum voices are retained with exact slice preparation and bounded arithmetic optimization."
